WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.600
The numbers by each row and column are its runs of shaded cells, in order.

2
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.800
Work one line at a time, and use what it tells you in the lines that cross it.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Match every line and a picture appears for your gallery.

4
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.000
Solved. The picture joins your gallery, and the next one is brand new.
